{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/126","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/126/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/126/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/126/events","html_url":"https://github.com/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/126","id":121201812,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxMjEyMDE4MTI=","number":126,"title":"False positive with __all__ and submodules","user":{"login":"pylint-bot","id":16198247,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTk4MjQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16198247?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/pylint-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":297274515,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTcyNzQ1MTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/labels/Bug%20:beetle:","name":"Bug :beetle:","color":"ea9896","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2014-01-02T15:58:24Z","updated_at":"2015-12-09T10:09:15Z","closed_at":"2015-12-09T10:09:14Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Originally reported by: **Boris FELD (BitBucket: [lothiraldan](http://bitbucket.org/lothiraldan), GitHub: @lothiraldan?)**\n\n---\n\nHi I just get a bug report by mail:\n\n```\nI believe the new E0603 error is incorrectly flagging valid code. In particular when __all__ is part of the __init__.py file of a package the contents can refer to sub-modules of the package i.e.,\n\nmypkg/\n   __init__.py\n   one.py\n   two.py\n\nif __init__.py has this:\n\n__all__ = [ \"one\" ]\n\nthen the affect of \"from mypkg import *\" is to import sub-module one, but not sub-module two. pylint is now flagging this as an error b/c \"one\" is not a variable defined within __init__.py\n\nWhat's worse is that if you specify E0603 in the disable line of an .rc config file, it is ignored and the error is still printed.\n```\n\nI wasn't aware of this behavior of **all** and submodules. I think it will be difficult to fix because we do analysis per module for this error if I remember correctly and in order to fix the false positive, we must be able to check or defer check we we have the list of all modules and submodules.\n\n---\n- Bitbucket: https://bitbucket.org/logilab/pylint/issue/126\n","closed_by":{"login":"pylint-bot","id":16198247,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTk4MjQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16198247?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/pylint-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/subscriptions","o